[{:adr/authoritative_for ["new kotoba-lang repo `standard-model`: zero-dep .cljc, six namespaces\n    kotoba.sm.{complex,tensor,vector-field,spinor,gauge,standard-model}" "complex.cljc is the shared complex-scalar + complex-matrix algebra layer\n    (add/mul/conj/dagger/commutator/trace) that spinor.cljc and gauge.cljc both\n    build their fixed-size matrices (gamma, Pauli, Gell-Mann) on top of" "tensor.cljc fixes the Minkowski metric convention as mostly-minus\n    diag(1,-1,-1,-1) (Bjorken-Drell), documented explicitly since mostly-plus is\n    the other common QFT-textbook convention" "gauge.cljc derives structure constants f^abc generically for any generator\n    set via f^abc = -2i Tr([T^a,T^b] T^c), not hard-coded, checked against\n    textbook SU(2)/SU(3) values" "standard-model.cljc composes: fermion generation table checked against\n    Gell-Mann-Nishijima Q=T3+Y/2, electroweak mixing (Weinberg angle, W/Z/photon,\n    M_W=M_Z cos(theta_W) derived not assumed), Higgs potential+vev+Yukawa masses,\n    CKM matrix (Wolfenstein) with unitarity check, full 3-factor covariant\n    derivative, Lagrangian-density term assembly (Yang-Mills+Dirac+Higgs+Yukawa)" "scope is the CLASSICAL field algebra only: equations of motion and defining\n    algebraic relations, evaluated numerically. Quantization, renormalization/RGE,\n    scattering amplitudes, lattice simulation, and PMNS/neutrino-oscillation are\n    explicitly deferred (not implemented this pass)" "distinct domain from existing kotoba-lang physics/physics-2d/vphysics (those\n    are game-engine rigid-body and vehicle physics, no QFT/particle content) and\n    from kotoba-lang/num (N-D array/WGSL ML tensor engine, different abstraction\n    level, ADR-2607051400) -- no overlap/duplication" "follows CLAUDE.md standing 'new project' authorization (2026-06-28): ADR ->\n    scaffold -> git init+commit -> gh repo create kotoba-lang/standard-model\n    --public + push -> repos.edn + gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry standard-model\n    -> this ADR + manifest reflected in superproject" "landed 2026-07-05: github.com/kotoba-lang/standard-model (public), 22 tests /\n    85 assertions passing, CI green (JDK 17+21); manifest registration verified\n    via gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry standard-model (minimal diff, server-side\n    pin check OK)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-standard-model", :adr/related ["adr-2607051400" "adr-2606302300"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607051500-kotoba-lang-standard-model-field-theory-library", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-05", :adr/body "see 2607051500-kotoba-lang-standard-model-field-theory-library.edn", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-05", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607051500: kotoba-lang/standard-model — gauge/tensor/vector/spinor field library computing classical Standard Model field content in .cljc", :adr/source-format "edn"}]